  /// the first ListAlerts request, omit this value. For subsequent requests,
  /// get the value of NextToken from the previous response and specify that
  /// value for NextToken in the request. Continue making requests until the
  /// response no longer includes a NextToken value, which indicates that all
  /// results have been retrieved.
  pub next_token: Str? = None
  /// The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the resource.
  pub resource_arn: Str? = None
}

