  /// A complex type that contains settings for prefetch retrieval from the ad
  /// decision server (ADS).
  pub retrieval: PrefetchRetrieval? = None
  /// The frequency that MediaTailor creates prefetch schedules. SINGLE
  /// indicates that this schedule applies to one ad break. RECURRING
  /// indicates that MediaTailor automatically creates a schedule for each ad
  /// avail in a live event. For more information about the prefetch types and
